.
.  Generate sample output for scatter plot matrix
.
dimension 25 variables
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na spmatr.ps
device 2 postscript
.
SKIP 25
COLUMN LIMITS 20 132
READ AUTO79.DAT Y1 TO Y9
COLUMN LIMITS
SKIP 0
RENAME Y1  PRICE
RENAME Y2  MILEAGE
RENAME Y3  REP1978
RENAME Y4  REP1977
RENAME Y5  HEADROOM
RENAME Y6  REARSEAT
RENAME Y7  TRUNKSPA
RENAME Y8  WEIGHT
RENAME Y9  LENGTH
.
CHAR X
LINE BLANK
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 10 10 90 90
SET SCATTER PLOT MATRIX FIT LOWESS
LOWESS FRACTION 0.6
TIC MARK LABEL SIZE 18
LABEL SIZE 18
CHAR SIZE 4
TIC OFFSET UNITS SCREEN
TIC OFFSET 5 5
MAJOR TIC MARK NUMBER 3
.
SCATTER PLOT MATRIX PRICE MILEAGE REP1978 HEADROOM TRUNKSPA WEIGHT LENGTH
.
MOVE 50 96
JUSTIFICATION CENTER
HEIGHT 3.5
TEXT 1979 Automobile Analysis
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv SPMATR.PS spmatr.ps
.
quit
